WEBVTT

00:05.670 --> 00:06.800
[sighs]

00:07.380 --> 00:08.800
[gasps] Where am I?

00:10.390 --> 00:11.680
Oh, it's nice.

00:12.890 --> 00:13.890
[sighs]

00:13.970 --> 00:15.390
-[water bubbling]
-Hmm?

00:16.140 --> 00:17.140
What's that?

00:17.230 --> 00:18.100
Whoa!

00:20.730 --> 00:22.560
[whimpers] What the…

00:23.520 --> 00:27.530
[distorted] Saotome.

00:28.150 --> 00:29.030
Kuno!

00:29.110 --> 00:32.740
You're my love.

00:32.820 --> 00:34.240
[screams]

00:34.330 --> 00:36.330
[shivering]

00:42.210 --> 00:46.460
RANMA1/2

02:08.670 --> 02:09.920
BECAUSE THERE'S SOMEONE HE LIKES

02:10.000 --> 02:11.670
[mob roaring]

02:11.760 --> 02:13.840
Tendo, let's go today!

02:13.930 --> 02:16.140
Saotome, step away from her now!

02:16.720 --> 02:18.140
Ugh. Give me a break already.

02:18.220 --> 02:19.390
-[crash]
-[mob screaming]

02:19.470 --> 02:20.520
I hate men!

02:20.600 --> 02:22.600
[bell ringing]

02:24.850 --> 02:26.060
Why is this here?

02:26.150 --> 02:27.150
It's a present.

02:28.060 --> 02:29.940
-No thanks.
-Hey!

02:30.820 --> 02:33.320
Who said it was for you, Nabiki Tendo?

02:34.450 --> 02:35.700
It's for the…

02:35.780 --> 02:37.820
Uh, for the…

02:37.910 --> 02:39.990
[Kuno] The adorable girl with the braid.

02:42.370 --> 02:44.330
I wasted my soy milk because of you.

02:44.410 --> 02:45.330
You narcissist.

02:46.920 --> 02:49.090
A set of five for 3,000 yen.

02:49.170 --> 02:51.130
[stammering]

02:51.210 --> 02:53.130
This is my girl with the braid!

02:53.760 --> 02:56.800
Oh, her guard's all the way down. [grunts]

02:56.890 --> 02:58.390
Kinda like a boy, right?

02:59.510 --> 03:01.060
It's not very respectable.

03:01.140 --> 03:03.350
You switched off Akane way too fast.

03:03.430 --> 03:04.680
Who said I switched off?

03:04.770 --> 03:05.890
[gasps]

03:07.020 --> 03:08.400
You're not hoping to cheat on her?

03:08.480 --> 03:11.400
[scoffs] That's not very nice.

03:11.480 --> 03:13.530
<i>Akane is pure and innocent.</i>

03:14.190 --> 03:16.280
<i>And the pigtailed girl's a sporty beauty.</i>

03:17.240 --> 03:20.030
They're both so cute,
I simply can't let either of them go!

03:20.700 --> 03:25.040
So my heart is crying out for the chance
to date the both of them simultaneously!

03:25.120 --> 03:27.080
So in other words…

03:28.580 --> 03:30.500
you're wanting to two-time this girl!

03:30.590 --> 03:32.840
Set of five for 4,000.

03:32.920 --> 03:34.510
You heartless entrepreneur.

03:35.090 --> 03:36.760
-Deal!
-Cash, please.

03:37.590 --> 03:38.890
Hey, Ranma.

03:38.970 --> 03:40.800
Kuno wants to see you.

03:40.890 --> 03:43.220
Really? What does he want now?

03:44.180 --> 03:45.850
[Akane] <i>What is she up to?</i>

03:46.430 --> 03:49.440
Wh-What the hell are you doing?

03:49.940 --> 03:51.690
That's what I want to know!

03:51.770 --> 03:53.480
If you wish to give her a gift,

03:53.570 --> 03:56.690
doing so through Ranma would be
the most expedited way.

03:56.780 --> 03:59.160
-No thanks.
-Whoa, careful with that!

03:59.660 --> 04:01.700
You should just forget
about that girl already.

04:01.780 --> 04:02.620
What?

04:02.700 --> 04:08.080
[scoffs] If I made a wild guess, I'd bet
you'll probably never see her again.

04:08.160 --> 04:10.540
Wait. No, hold on.

04:11.130 --> 04:12.460
What did you say?

04:12.540 --> 04:15.630
You should accept that the two of you
live in different worlds.

04:18.930 --> 04:19.760
[splutters]

04:19.840 --> 04:22.140
Hey, man. What if someone was down there?

04:22.220 --> 04:24.510
Never see her again? [grunts]

04:26.270 --> 04:28.430
What do you mean by that, Saotome?

04:30.140 --> 04:32.980
[scoffs] He's quick
when he's running away.

04:33.060 --> 04:34.070
[grunts]

04:37.490 --> 04:38.610
Ouch! Uh-oh.

04:38.700 --> 04:39.530
[gasps]

04:39.610 --> 04:41.410
Hmph. My pigtailed girl!

04:42.120 --> 04:44.280
-I'm never letting go of you!
-[straining]

04:44.830 --> 04:48.410
-Apologies in advance for this, Ranma.
-[screams] That's hot!

04:48.500 --> 04:49.750
Ranma?

04:50.330 --> 04:51.920
Get your hands off me.

04:52.000 --> 04:54.920
-Stop holding me, you idiot!
-[punches landing]

04:56.800 --> 04:59.470
Do you finally get it now? See you.

04:59.550 --> 05:01.180
[growls]

05:01.680 --> 05:03.010
Hold it!

05:03.090 --> 05:06.010
I will not be fooled
by some cheap party tricks!

05:06.100 --> 05:08.140
Huh? What? You don't get it.

05:08.640 --> 05:09.520
Huh.

05:10.520 --> 05:12.520
All right, listen carefully.

05:12.600 --> 05:14.400
The girl with the braid…

05:14.480 --> 05:19.490
Her body and soul… [sobs]
…they all belong to Ranma!

05:19.570 --> 05:20.650
Hmm?

05:20.740 --> 05:22.780
You understand, don't you?

05:23.660 --> 05:24.490
Huh?

05:28.290 --> 05:30.160
[growling]

05:32.080 --> 05:34.460
-You are an enemy of women!
-[Ranma] Hey!

05:34.540 --> 05:36.000
You're getting the wrong idea.

05:36.090 --> 05:39.340
[Kuno] I will destroy you!
I'm using my power to save her!

05:39.420 --> 05:40.470
[sighs]

05:40.550 --> 05:42.090
[grunts] Oh, really?

05:42.840 --> 05:46.350
Okay then. If you lose this match,
you give up on the girl with the braid.

05:46.430 --> 05:47.600
Never!

05:51.060 --> 05:52.060
Huh?

05:53.560 --> 05:55.400
-Whoa!
-Gotcha!

05:56.690 --> 05:57.570
[gasps]

05:58.860 --> 06:00.490
You can't get away.

06:04.240 --> 06:06.450
Whoa!

06:07.030 --> 06:08.330
[gasps] Huh?

06:08.410 --> 06:09.620
Hi, Akane.

06:13.210 --> 06:14.580
Just for your information,

06:14.670 --> 06:17.170
Kuno can get brutal against men.

06:17.250 --> 06:19.960
All he needs to do is
get serious enough about it.

06:20.590 --> 06:22.880
Ooh. And just for your information,

06:23.800 --> 06:25.090
blue panties don't look good on you.

06:25.890 --> 06:27.600
Go die for all I care!

06:27.680 --> 06:30.100
-That's enough playtime.
-Hmm?

06:30.970 --> 06:33.180
-Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab!
-[exclaims]

06:33.270 --> 06:35.190
Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab!

06:35.270 --> 06:37.310
-[grunts]
-[blast]

06:38.900 --> 06:40.900
-[screams]
-Stay out of the way!

06:41.570 --> 06:42.570
Final blow!

06:42.650 --> 06:45.400
[gasps] Idiot!
Keep your eyes on the fight.

06:46.030 --> 06:47.490
[Ranma] Hyah!

06:48.530 --> 06:50.490
[kicks reverberate]

06:50.580 --> 06:51.580
[grunts]

06:56.500 --> 06:58.500
What was all that? The kicks!

06:58.580 --> 06:59.880
Oh, well, uh…

07:01.050 --> 07:04.010
Wow! I think you hit
every one of his weak points.

07:04.090 --> 07:06.590
-It turns out he was pretty easy to beat.
-[bones creak]

07:06.680 --> 07:09.470
Was he really though?
I'm fairly sure he got a blow in.

07:09.550 --> 07:12.470
Hmph. That little baby hit wasn't nothing.

07:12.560 --> 07:13.850
Are you sure you're okay?

07:13.930 --> 07:17.100
I barely remember it, 'cause it
doesn't hurt-- [screams, sobbing]

07:17.190 --> 07:20.980
Huh? Don't pretend it doesn't hurt
when it literally makes you cry.

07:21.570 --> 07:24.820
I knew it. You seemed distracted
in the fight earlier.

07:24.900 --> 07:27.110
-Huh?
-[sobbing continues]

07:27.780 --> 07:30.160
Wait. Wh… What the heck are these?

07:30.240 --> 07:31.660
You should ask Kuno, not me.

07:31.740 --> 07:34.790
He bought them off of me.
I wanted a little extra cash.

07:34.870 --> 07:36.000
You what?

07:36.080 --> 07:39.880
[Ranma] Ha! All these pictures are so
boring anyway, who would even want them?

07:39.960 --> 07:40.790
[stamps foot]

07:40.880 --> 07:44.710
If we compare the two of us, you don't
even have half the sex appeal that I do.

07:45.970 --> 07:46.800
Hmm?

07:46.880 --> 07:47.930
OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC -
CHIROPRACTOR

07:48.010 --> 07:48.890
ACUPUNCTURE - ACUPRESSURE

07:48.970 --> 07:51.470
Hmm. You're in bad shape.

07:51.550 --> 07:53.890
-Aside from this nasty bokuto strike,
-[groaning]

07:54.470 --> 07:57.310
you also have severe contusions
and dislocations.

07:58.350 --> 07:59.980
-Who was it that did this?
-[yelps]

08:00.060 --> 08:01.610
Well, uh…

08:01.690 --> 08:02.730
It was…

08:02.820 --> 08:03.900
[coughs]

08:03.980 --> 08:04.940
Hmm?

08:05.030 --> 08:06.990
[hoarsely] A girl who suffers from
no sex appea--

08:07.070 --> 08:08.700
-Oh, I'm so sorry!
-[shrieks]

08:09.910 --> 08:10.910
[grunts]

08:11.990 --> 08:13.490
Was this your doing, Akane?

08:13.580 --> 08:15.830
Uh, maybe, but it's because…

08:15.910 --> 08:19.080
<i>Pfft. Yeah, now you're doing</i>
<i>the cute girl act.</i>

08:19.170 --> 08:20.290
-[grunts]
-Mmm.

08:20.370 --> 08:23.590
[chuckles] I knew it.
It was obvious it was you right away.

08:23.670 --> 08:25.670
-[laughs]
-[sighs]

08:25.760 --> 08:28.130
The way you dislocated
this joint in particular.

08:28.220 --> 08:30.840
So interesting to see
your signature move this way.

08:30.930 --> 08:31.930
[Akane] Really?

08:32.010 --> 08:33.050
-[bones crack]
-[screams]

08:33.140 --> 08:34.970
So, you're Ranma, right?

08:35.060 --> 08:35.970
-[cracks]
-[whimpers]

08:36.600 --> 08:39.100
I heard you were chosen
to be Akane's fiancé.

08:39.190 --> 08:41.440
Our parents made that decision
on their own.

08:41.520 --> 08:43.690
[Tofu] Yes, it's a bit early for all that.

08:43.770 --> 08:45.860
[chuckles] The two of you are still kids.

08:45.940 --> 08:47.570
-I guess so.
-[Ranma groaning]

08:48.360 --> 08:50.070
<i>So I'm still a kid.</i>

08:51.320 --> 08:52.870
Stop! That hurts.

08:52.950 --> 08:55.580
Oh! Well that's strange.
Where are you still hurting?

08:55.660 --> 08:57.500
What? Oh, uh…

08:57.580 --> 08:59.410
Huh? Hey.

09:00.040 --> 09:02.210
-Dr. Tofu is very good at his job.
-[Ranma] Hmm.

09:04.840 --> 09:06.460
-Oh, Ranma, can we talk?
-Hmm?

09:06.550 --> 09:07.800
Yeah?

09:07.880 --> 09:11.720
Regardless of your betrothal,
do try and get along with Akane.

09:12.970 --> 09:15.720
It's not like I go out of my way
to pick a fight with her.

09:16.350 --> 09:18.720
She's the one who keeps picking on me.

09:18.810 --> 09:19.810
[chuckles]

09:20.310 --> 09:22.020
But still. She's a real sweet girl.

09:22.100 --> 09:23.440
-Is she?
-[chuckles]

09:26.860 --> 09:28.440
You'll understand one day.

09:29.530 --> 09:31.360
[Akane] What were you two talking about?

09:31.450 --> 09:32.530
[Ranma] Ah, nothing.

09:32.610 --> 09:34.910
Only that you're a lot to handle
'cause you're such a tomboy.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.540
<i>Huh. Coming at me?</i>

09:38.660 --> 09:39.830
-[Akane] I see.
-Huh?

09:40.330 --> 09:41.500
Hmm?

09:46.250 --> 09:47.250
Hmm?

09:47.880 --> 09:49.210
Hmm? Hmm?

09:50.420 --> 09:52.170
I was just kidding.

09:52.260 --> 09:54.140
Getting all girlie and heartbroken now.

09:54.930 --> 09:56.220
What are you trying to say?

09:56.300 --> 09:57.680
[jeers] There you are.

09:57.760 --> 10:00.390
I almost didn't recognize you
without you getting mad at me.

10:00.470 --> 10:02.270
-What did you say?
-Whoa.

10:02.350 --> 10:04.850
-Get back here. [grunts]
-[chuckles] Too slow!

10:04.940 --> 10:09.070
Four, three, two, one.

10:09.150 --> 10:10.150
Whoa.

10:12.030 --> 10:13.240
What's the matter with you?

10:13.320 --> 10:14.780
My legs. Oh.

10:15.410 --> 10:20.410
<i>Ugh, that jerk. He must've done something</i>
<i>when he patted my back earlier.</i>

10:22.410 --> 10:25.250
All right. Guess I don't have a choice.

10:25.330 --> 10:27.000
Uh, wait. What are you doing?

10:27.080 --> 10:28.960
Piggyback. You can't walk, can you?

10:29.050 --> 10:30.960
I… No way!

10:31.050 --> 10:32.840
That's so embarrassing for a man to…

10:32.920 --> 10:33.970
[shrieks] That's cold!

10:35.640 --> 10:37.470
It shouldn't be a problem
if we're both girls.

10:40.890 --> 10:42.430
I'm not too heavy, am I?

10:42.520 --> 10:44.980
Stop worrying about it.
You can't even stand up.

10:46.230 --> 10:49.570
-[Tofu] <i>She's a real sweet girl.</i>
-[Ranma] <i>I guess she can be.</i>

10:50.440 --> 10:51.900
[Tofu] <i>You'll understand one day.</i>

10:51.980 --> 10:53.650
[Ranma] <i>Nope, still not getting it.</i>

10:56.990 --> 10:58.780
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS
TENDO DOJO

10:58.870 --> 11:00.370
[screams]

11:01.330 --> 11:02.200
[grunts]

11:02.290 --> 11:06.920
Mr. Saotome, and Ranma too.
Your breakfast is ready now.

11:07.000 --> 11:08.000
-[punch lands]
-Oh.

11:08.080 --> 11:10.920
-Thanks for telling us, Kasumi.
-[Ranma] No, no, no. Whoa!

11:12.170 --> 11:14.550
STARTING TODAY, I HAVE
A PART-TIME JOB. - GENMA SAOTOME

11:14.630 --> 11:17.590
You got a job? You planning on working
part-time in a zoo?

11:17.680 --> 11:18.510
'Cause, uh…

11:18.590 --> 11:19.430
WRONG!

11:19.510 --> 11:21.140
[Akane] Could you pass the soy sauce?

11:21.220 --> 11:23.970
Morning training, huh? Well, good for you.

11:24.060 --> 11:25.350
Good morning.

11:26.060 --> 11:27.060
[Tendo exclaims]

11:27.140 --> 11:28.150
[Ranma] Dang, it's hot!

11:28.230 --> 11:31.860
Come on now, Ranma.
Are you missing any sense of modesty?

11:36.950 --> 11:39.450
Oh, to hell with all that. Screw modesty.

11:39.530 --> 11:40.870
You have no shame.

11:41.370 --> 11:44.040
Like a tomboy has any right
to try and shame me.

11:44.540 --> 11:45.620
[Kasumi] Before I forget,

11:45.700 --> 11:48.620
could you two stop by Dr. Tofu's office
on your way back?

11:49.630 --> 11:52.840
If it's okay, I'd like you
to return the book I borrowed.

11:52.920 --> 11:55.920
[sighs] You can't do it yourself?

11:56.010 --> 11:57.930
I'm a little too busy today.

11:58.010 --> 12:00.550
[Kasumi] Oh, okay.
Yeah, I guess I can go do it.

12:01.050 --> 12:03.260
-But that would be the perfect excuse--
-[grunts]

12:03.350 --> 12:04.520
We'll be late.

12:05.020 --> 12:07.730
-[dishes clatter]
-[Ranma exclaiming] No! [groans]

12:11.230 --> 12:13.650
-[Ranma] A-Akane, wait just a second!
-[Akane] Shut up!

12:13.730 --> 12:16.280
[Ranma whimpering]

12:16.360 --> 12:18.700
Ranma, you need to keep
that big mouth shut!

12:18.780 --> 12:20.740
Come on now. What's that supposed to mean?

12:20.820 --> 12:23.370
I was clear.
Keep that big mouth of yours shut.

12:24.120 --> 12:24.950
Uh…

12:25.040 --> 12:26.080
Uh…

12:26.160 --> 12:27.960
This is why I was telling you to wait.

12:28.040 --> 12:29.580
-I didn't realize.
-[gasps]

12:30.960 --> 12:33.500
What the hell are you all doing?
Wanting a free show?

12:33.590 --> 12:34.800
Who wants to go first?

12:36.090 --> 12:38.010
[grunts] Akane Tendo.

12:43.220 --> 12:45.180
We will no longer challenge you to fight.

12:45.260 --> 12:46.180
Wha…

12:47.270 --> 12:48.930
-[mob sobbing]
-We all agreed.

12:49.020 --> 12:52.190
We decided to accept the fact
that you're engaged now.

12:52.270 --> 12:53.230
-Huh?
-[sighs]

12:53.310 --> 12:55.020
-That's what this is about?
-[sobbing continues]

12:55.110 --> 12:56.190
But why now?

12:56.820 --> 13:00.650
[Kuno] Well, rumor has it
that Ranma Saotome defeated me.

13:01.240 --> 13:03.240
Which is such an absurd falsehood.

13:04.660 --> 13:07.410
However, I refuse to be defeated!

13:08.330 --> 13:11.750
Kuno was the strongest person left
at Furinkan High School.

13:11.830 --> 13:14.000
But he was also
the biggest pervert of us all.

13:14.080 --> 13:15.540
What on earth did you just call me?

13:16.670 --> 13:17.800
I won't give up.

13:18.420 --> 13:20.470
I'll battle any coward like Ranma.

13:20.970 --> 13:24.800
They can kick me a hundred times over.
I refuse to process the pain.

13:24.890 --> 13:27.680
[grunts] Who do you think you're calling
a coward?

13:27.770 --> 13:28.680
Hmm?

13:28.770 --> 13:31.190
You don't have to be
such a sore loser, you know.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.440
[Kuno] Whoa!

13:32.520 --> 13:34.520
[whimpering]

13:35.440 --> 13:38.190
My little lady with the braid is
finally here.

13:38.280 --> 13:39.400
[gasps]

13:39.490 --> 13:42.110
Seriously, you need to remember
what gender you are.

13:43.530 --> 13:44.700
I've missed you so.

13:44.780 --> 13:46.450
But wait a sec.

13:46.530 --> 13:48.370
I thought Akane was the one you liked.

13:48.450 --> 13:49.700
Of course I do.

13:49.790 --> 13:51.120
She's watching, you know.

13:51.790 --> 13:54.420
-Hmm?
-How did I not realize, Kuno?

13:55.130 --> 13:58.710
If you like her more,
then I'll happily step aside.

13:58.800 --> 13:59.670
-Oh.
-[stutters]

13:59.760 --> 14:01.050
Akane Tendo!

14:01.130 --> 14:02.220
What are you talking about?

14:02.300 --> 14:04.760
[Kuno] <i>Her offer to step aside is</i>
<i>so endearing.</i>

14:05.430 --> 14:07.810
<i>And she's so adorable, I can't let go.</i>

14:08.430 --> 14:09.850
I love both of you!

14:12.560 --> 14:14.100
[grunting]

14:19.860 --> 14:21.650
[students] Whoa!

14:22.320 --> 14:23.900
That was great, Saotome.

14:23.990 --> 14:27.700
Well, yeah. Didn't he study acrobatics
or something when he went to China?

14:27.780 --> 14:28.780
It was kempo.

14:29.410 --> 14:32.290
By the way, how far have you gotten
with Akane?

14:32.370 --> 14:33.250
Hmm?

14:33.330 --> 14:35.750
Come on, we know she's your fiancée.
Don't play dumb.

14:35.830 --> 14:36.670
Huh?

14:36.750 --> 14:39.960
So you guys must be doing
some pretty freaky stuff, am I right?

14:40.050 --> 14:41.170
No. Nothing.

14:41.260 --> 14:43.670
You liar. I'm betting
you two are crazy dirty.

14:43.760 --> 14:46.470
How much insane sex do you do
every day, bro?

14:46.550 --> 14:47.680
We don't do anything!

14:48.720 --> 14:50.140
[grunts] Get it, Akane!

14:50.220 --> 14:51.310
Yeah!

14:52.560 --> 14:53.560
Way to go!

14:53.640 --> 14:55.390
All right. Now it's our turn.

14:56.400 --> 14:57.900
[giggling]

15:00.320 --> 15:01.530
[gasps]

15:01.610 --> 15:03.610
-Damn. Look at how cute she is.
-Huh?

15:04.150 --> 15:06.160
That girl is in no way cute.

15:06.240 --> 15:08.530
Besides, she has a crush
on someone else anyway.

15:08.620 --> 15:09.870
Yeah?

15:10.700 --> 15:11.790
[thuds]

15:12.450 --> 15:13.790
[student] Hey, Saotome.

15:13.870 --> 15:16.370
Aren't you supposed to be a kempo expert?

15:16.460 --> 15:17.540
Mm-hmm.

15:17.630 --> 15:20.710
I guess kempo doesn't do
too much blocking or dodging.

15:21.250 --> 15:23.510
I was a little distracted.

15:24.170 --> 15:26.470
I'm sorry. Does it still hurt?

15:27.680 --> 15:30.510
Hey, I've apologized to you,
like, 30 times now.

15:30.600 --> 15:31.720
-Hmm?
-[sweeping]

15:31.810 --> 15:32.720
Oh, hey.

15:33.390 --> 15:35.770
[Ranma] Old Man?
What are you doing here in the street?

15:37.140 --> 15:40.310
[Tofu] Really?
So my new hire is your father?

15:40.400 --> 15:42.110
You two don't look much alike.

15:42.190 --> 15:44.530
By the way, what happened to your face?

15:44.610 --> 15:46.150
Accident in P.E. class.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.240
[Akane sighs]

15:47.320 --> 15:50.450
I have an ointment that will work wonders
on that. Just one second.

15:51.120 --> 15:52.330
[rings]

15:59.250 --> 16:00.380
[Ranma] Hmm?

16:00.460 --> 16:02.130
AAARGH! PANDAS CAN'T TALK!

16:02.210 --> 16:03.880
So why did you pick up the phone?

16:04.550 --> 16:06.630
Hello? How can I help you today?

16:07.630 --> 16:08.680
Uh…

16:09.340 --> 16:11.720
Sure. Understood. 'Kay, bye.

16:12.220 --> 16:13.640
I'm gonna head home.

16:14.770 --> 16:16.480
Did something end up happening?

16:16.560 --> 16:17.890
No, not really.

16:17.980 --> 16:20.150
Great. Why you heading off in such a rush?

16:20.230 --> 16:22.110
-I mean, you like the doctor. Hmm?
-[grunts]

16:24.440 --> 16:25.570
[whispers] Stop it.

16:25.650 --> 16:27.820
There's already another person
that he likes, okay?

16:27.900 --> 16:29.320
[gasps]

16:30.240 --> 16:31.570
That was her on the phone.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.830
She said she'll be coming over soon.

16:35.620 --> 16:38.120
-[visitor] Hello? Good afternoon.
-[Akane gasps]

16:38.750 --> 16:41.080
Whoa! She's the one he has a crush on?

16:41.170 --> 16:42.840
[shivers] He's got a type.

16:42.920 --> 16:44.090
Not her!

16:44.880 --> 16:46.920
[person] <i>You're leaving already, Kasumi?</i>

16:47.010 --> 16:49.090
[Kasumi] <i>Just heading to the chiropractor.</i>

16:49.170 --> 16:50.510
[Ranma] Kasumi?

16:51.970 --> 16:54.890
Dr. Tofu has a crush on Kasumi.

16:55.890 --> 16:57.600
It's obvious from the way he acts.

16:58.680 --> 16:59.690
[sighs]

17:00.690 --> 17:01.810
[Ranma gasps]

17:01.900 --> 17:03.690
Hey, you two. What are you doing out here?

17:03.770 --> 17:05.610
Uh, n-nothing at all.

17:06.150 --> 17:07.530
R-Right?

17:07.610 --> 17:08.610
[sighs]

17:11.450 --> 17:12.950
So much for heading out.

17:13.030 --> 17:15.660
-Now, let's see the damage.
-[grunts]

17:16.490 --> 17:18.620
Oh. A mark from a ball.

17:18.700 --> 17:20.830
Akane must have hit this one, right?

17:20.910 --> 17:22.250
-[gasps]
-[gulps]

17:22.750 --> 17:26.500
The depth and angle of the stitches were
what ultimately gave it away.

17:26.590 --> 17:29.590
Wow. So you can tell
how feral she is just from that?

17:29.670 --> 17:33.050
Come on! You weren't paying attention
so this is your fault.

17:33.140 --> 17:34.220
-Oh.
-Ah.

17:35.350 --> 17:38.680
Sorry. I was just joking around.
[chuckles]

17:39.640 --> 17:40.640
[Akane] Uh…

17:41.270 --> 17:42.100
<i>Dummy.</i>

17:42.190 --> 17:45.650
[Tofu] There's nothing wrong with it.
You know? It's good to stay active.

17:45.730 --> 17:48.150
-[Akane] But, still…
-[Tofu] It's good that you're so healthy.

17:48.230 --> 17:49.570
[Ranma] Not sexy though.

17:51.700 --> 17:53.320
Good afternoon.

17:53.410 --> 17:55.030
Oh, Kasumi.

17:55.120 --> 17:56.240
-[bones crack]
-[grunts]

17:56.870 --> 17:58.080
Uh…

17:58.160 --> 17:59.290
Hello?

17:59.370 --> 18:01.250
Did I hear a wet snap just now?

18:01.910 --> 18:03.620
Hey, Kasumi.

18:03.710 --> 18:06.380
Oh. Hi, Ranma. What's wrong?

18:06.460 --> 18:09.380
Nothing wrong.
He started coming in recently.

18:09.460 --> 18:11.220
Right, Ranma?

18:11.300 --> 18:12.260
I SAID I'M RANMA'S POP!

18:12.340 --> 18:13.340
Hey, Doc?

18:13.970 --> 18:15.390
[Tofu] So, how can I help you?

18:15.470 --> 18:18.390
Oh, yes.
Bringing back the book I borrowed.

18:18.470 --> 18:19.470
[Ranma] Hey, Doc?

18:19.560 --> 18:21.850
Also, I wasn't sure if you wanted these.

18:22.600 --> 18:24.230
[Tofu] Oh, thank you. [chuckles]

18:24.310 --> 18:25.850
It's a mask, isn't it?

18:25.940 --> 18:27.900
[Kasumi] No, that wasn't the gift.

18:28.480 --> 18:31.400
-Dr. Tofu.
-[chewing] This is great.

18:31.490 --> 18:34.240
-I'm stuck.
-Actually, that's the plate.

18:34.780 --> 18:36.200
Doctor!

18:36.280 --> 18:38.830
Hmm. Uh, something I can help you with?

18:38.910 --> 18:40.120
My neck hurts!

18:40.200 --> 18:42.700
Another injury? All right then.

18:42.790 --> 18:43.790
Are you serious?

18:43.870 --> 18:46.210
Sit, sit.
I can fix that right up actually.

18:46.290 --> 18:47.630
-Here.
-[groans]

18:47.710 --> 18:51.340
I'm sorry, Mr. Saotome,
would you mind getting Kasumi some tea?

18:51.420 --> 18:52.300
HEY! OVER HERE!

18:52.380 --> 18:53.380
[shouts]

18:53.470 --> 18:56.640
Dr. Tofu is always so funny to watch,
wouldn't you say?

18:57.140 --> 18:58.220
Oh, you think?

18:58.850 --> 19:01.930
He never acts like this
whenever you're not around, big sister.

19:02.020 --> 19:03.100
Oh?

19:06.520 --> 19:07.810
[grunting]

19:07.900 --> 19:09.520
[objects clatter]

19:14.900 --> 19:17.450
<i>What's she doing? Is she crying?</i>

19:19.580 --> 19:20.580
[sighs]

19:23.000 --> 19:24.500
I don't like feeling this way.

19:25.750 --> 19:26.750
Oh!

19:28.290 --> 19:30.130
-[growls]
-Ow!

19:30.210 --> 19:31.500
[panting]

19:31.590 --> 19:33.630
Well, I guess that proves you're fine.

19:35.880 --> 19:38.890
Please don't tell me that was
your crappy attempt at cheering me up.

19:38.970 --> 19:40.600
Oopsy-daisy.

19:40.680 --> 19:42.220
-What's that supposed to mean?
-[bones crack]

19:42.310 --> 19:43.560
-Of course I was.
-Hmm?

19:43.640 --> 19:45.390
[groaning]

19:45.480 --> 19:46.850
Oh, my neck is fixed.

19:48.810 --> 19:49.860
[sighs]

19:49.940 --> 19:52.020
Okay. Wanna keep me company?

19:52.110 --> 19:53.110
[Ranma] Hmm?

19:53.190 --> 19:54.610
[grunting]

19:57.910 --> 19:59.240
Come on. Take a swing!

19:59.320 --> 20:00.320
I don't know…

20:00.410 --> 20:02.370
Here I come! [grunting]

20:03.370 --> 20:04.490
[shouts]

20:05.200 --> 20:06.370
-Whoa!
-[grunts]

20:06.460 --> 20:09.540
I'm trying to blow off some steam here,
so stop playing and let's go!

20:11.590 --> 20:15.460
Come on, now. Doesn't it get tiring
being this angry all the time?

20:15.550 --> 20:17.970
You don't need to worry about that.
[grunting]

20:20.300 --> 20:21.640
You know what I was thinking?

20:22.640 --> 20:24.350
You're really cute when you smile.

20:24.930 --> 20:26.100
Huh?

20:28.520 --> 20:29.900
Gotcha.

20:34.360 --> 20:36.740
No fair! That one doesn't count.

20:36.820 --> 20:38.530
-[whistling]
-Let's go again!

20:39.910 --> 20:41.110
[door opens]

20:44.660 --> 20:45.700
[sighs]

20:46.830 --> 20:48.120
[sighs]

20:51.000 --> 20:53.040
[Ranma] <i>You're really cute when you smile.</i>

20:54.040 --> 20:55.420
Did he mean that?

21:03.890 --> 21:05.010
[giggles]

21:05.510 --> 21:07.520
What's with this face you got going on?

21:07.600 --> 21:09.100
That's a creepy smirk.

21:09.690 --> 21:10.730
[Akane growls]

21:10.810 --> 21:13.230
-[smack]
-[Ranma grunts]

21:14.560 --> 21:17.190
So, your neck still hasn't healed yet?

21:17.280 --> 21:18.940
It was healed for, like, a minute.

21:19.030 --> 21:20.950
CHIROPRACTIC
